      value: 180
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: Why are quintic equations unsolvable?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: Another question
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: Any finite number of operations or functions will never produce a formula
        producing the roots
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: 'The quintic formula exists in a higher number system that does not
        abide by standard mathematical operations '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: The discriminant of the quintic does not exist, meaning that such a
        formula cannot exist as a result
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: wrong
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: wrong
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: right
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: That is the correct answer!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: "The quintic formula and higher degree polynomials do not exist in the
        sense that there\u2019s no general formula."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: This would include using only addition, subtraction, multiplication,
        division, and nth roots (radicals) to solve all quintic polynomials.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[3]._dialogueText
      value: "This means that an equation in the form ax\u2075 + bx\u2074 + cx\xB3
        + dx\xB2 + ex + f cannot have its roots found through a general formula."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[4]._dialogueText
      value: "This means that an equation in the form ax\u2075 + bx\u2074 + cx\xB3
        + dx\xB2 + ex + f cannot have its roots found through a general formula."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
